      <div class="policy-section" id="services">
        <h2>2. Products and Services</h2>
        <p>UWIN FLOORTECH is a B2B manufacturer and turnkey installer of sports flooring products, including but not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>PP (Polypropylene) Interlocking Modular Sports Tiles</li>
          <li>EPDM (Ethylene Propylene Diene Monomer) Rubberised Athletic Tracks and Play Area Surfaces</li>
          <li>Acrylic Court Coating Systems (including ITF-classified configurations)</li>
          <li>Badminton PVC Vinyl and Wooden Flooring</li>
          <li>Sand-Based Artificial Grass Systems</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We offer both material-only supply and turnkey installation services. The scope of supply is confirmed in writing at the time of order placement. All product specifications, certifications, and technical data are subject to change. Refer to the current Technical Data Sheet (TDS) issued with each order for confirmed specifications.</p>
        <p>All product images, technical drawings, and specifications on this Website are for illustrative purposes only and may differ from final manufactured product based on order-specific configurations.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="policy-divider" />

