          <li>Prices quoted are exclusive of Goods and Services Tax (GST), freight, transportation, civil work, and any other charges not explicitly stated in the quotation.</li>
          <li>Prices are subject to change based on raw material costs, market conditions, and logistical factors. Any revision will be communicated prior to order confirmation.</li>
          <li>Verbal pricing indications are not binding. Only written quotations issued by UWIN FLOORTECH on official letterhead or email constitute valid offers.</li>
        </ul>
