          <li>A standard advance payment is required to initiate material procurement and scheduling. The balance is payable as per the milestone schedule agreed in writing.</li>
          <li>All payments must be made via bank transfer (NEFT/RTGS/IMPS) to the bank account designated on our GST invoice.</li>
          <li>GST will be charged as applicable under Indian tax law. A valid GST invoice will be issued upon payment and delivery.</li>
          <li>Interest at 18% per annum may be charged on overdue payments beyond the agreed due date, calculated from the date of invoice.</li>
