          <li>Risk of loss or damage to materials passes to the client upon delivery to the designated site or freight carrier, as applicable.</li>
          <li>The client is responsible for ensuring adequate site access, storage space, and personnel for receipt of materials.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>6.2 Installation (Turnkey Projects)</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>The client is responsible for providing a prepared sub-base meeting the specifications communicated by UWIN FLOORTECH prior to installation commencement. UWIN FLOORTECH is not responsible for surface failure attributable to a non-compliant sub-base.</li>
          <li>Site conditions must be suitable for installation as per product application requirements (temperature, humidity, shade from direct sun during application where applicable).</li>
          <li>Delays caused by unavailability of site access, non-compliant sub-base, or incomplete civil work will extend project timelines accordingly. Any additional mobilisation costs arising from such delays will be charged to the client.</li>
          <li>Upon installation completion, a joint inspection and sign-off will be conducted. The client's signature on the completion certificate confirms acceptance of the installed surface.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

