          <li>The warranty is <strong>void</strong> if:
            <ul>
              <li>The product has been installed on a non-compliant or structurally deficient sub-base.</li>
              <li>Installation has not been performed by UWIN FLOORTECH or an approved installer following our specified layer schedule.</li>
              <li>The surface has been subjected to chemical exposure, vehicle loading beyond stated capacity, or wilful damage.</li>
              <li>Maintenance protocols recommended by UWIN FLOORTECH have not been followed.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>Warranty claims must be submitted in writing with photographic evidence within 30 days of defect identification. UWIN FLOORTECH will inspect and determine the appropriate remedy, which may include material replacement or patch repair at our discretion.</li>
